## 🔍 Useful Verification Commands

| Command | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `do sh ip int br` | Check all interface IPs |
| `do sh vlan` | Verify VLAN assignments on switch |
| `do sh run` | Show full running config |
| `do sh ip route` | Check routing table on router |

